  "display_title": "Comes with Benefits",
  "description": "23-year-old Jongsoo is your average guy who has nothing much to show for himself save his youth. He’s got an interest in video production but not much experience. When he sees a job post for Europe Entertainment, he figures he’ll apply and give it his best shot. But when he arrives at the building he’s pleasantly surprised by how nice it is…and by all the female workers he’s passing by… There’s something a bit suspicious about this place that he can’t quite put his finger on but Jongsoo, with nothing to lose, has decided to go all-in on this opportunity! Even if the place is a little weird, at least the job comes with some tempting benefits…!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
